WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.517
AI agents may

00:00:01.329 --> 00:00:02.177
soon shop for

00:00:01.989 --> 00:00:03.003
you on Amazon

00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:04.795
Amazon and Meta

00:00:04.607 --> 00:00:05.609
are reportedly in

00:00:05.421 --> 00:00:06.340
talks about how

00:00:06.152 --> 00:00:07.743
third-party AI systems

00:00:07.555 --> 00:00:08.416
can connect to

00:00:08.227 --> 00:00:09.654
Amazon's store and

00:00:09.466 --> 00:00:10.491
shop on users'

00:00:10.303 --> 00:00:11.010
behalf

00:00:11.542 --> 00:00:13.027
Amazon's CEO said

00:00:12.839 --> 00:00:13.947
in October that

00:00:13.806 --> 00:00:14.902
AI agents are

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:15.669
not yet having

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:16.813
a meaningful impact

00:00:16.636 --> 00:00:17.320
on its ads

00:00:17.132 --> 00:00:17.898
business

00:00:18.422 --> 00:00:19.707
Many shoppers stay

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:20.556
wary of trusting

00:00:20.415 --> 00:00:21.582
AI shopping agents

00:00:21.394 --> 00:00:22.183
completely

00:00:22.349 --> 00:00:23.575
but experts say

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.117
this may be

00:00:23.929 --> 00:00:24.884
the first Black

00:00:24.696 --> 00:00:26.063
Friday where agents

00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:26.511
matter

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:28.044
Full story on

00:00:27.855 --> 00:00:28.751
the dashboard
